  scoringMethod:'This controls how each job description is compared with your resume after basic filters. Semantic recognizes related meaning even when wording differs. TF-IDF rewards exact shared words and phrases. Hybrid combines both, favoring semantic meaning. Because all methods compare against your resume, a real resume is required.',
